# Normalise line endings.
#
# Several files in the working tree got converted from LF to CRLF by a Windows
# editor, which makes `git diff` show entire files as changed even when only a
# few lines moved. That noise makes code review effectively impossible.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` stores LF in the repository and checks out LF, which is
# what the rest of this codebase already uses.
#
# After adding this file, run once to normalise everything already tracked:
#
#   git add --renormalize .
#
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.avif  binary
*.mp4   binary
*.webm  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf   binary
